SCOPE

The MIT licence above covers the source code of this project. It does NOT
cover the third-party datasets and documents distributed alongside it, which
keep their own licences and in one case a different one entirely:

  * src/groundwater/data/sl_hydrogeology_bgs.geojson is derived from the BGS
    Africa Groundwater Atlas country hydrogeology map and is licensed
    CC BY-SA 4.0, not MIT. ShareAlike propagates, so every artefact that
    embeds it - docs/js/gwt-data.js and docs/wasm/index.html, both published
    from GitHub Pages - carries the same obligation.

  * The reference documents under WaterProjectFiles/ are third-party
    publications. No redistribution grant for them has been established; see
    THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists every bundled dataset and document with its
source, its licence, the attribution that licence requires, and - where the
terms could not be evidenced from the material itself - says so plainly
rather than assuming.
